      "title": "End Coating",
      "text": "7. End Coating — Shall be adequately coated up to a distance of at least 15 cm with any of the materials mentioned in IS 1141 : 1993*. *Code of Practice for preservation of timber (third revision) SUMMARY OF IS 7308 : 1999 NON-CONIFEROUS LOGS (First   Revision) For detailed information, refer to IS 7308 : 1999 Specification for non-coniferous logs (first revision).",
